[ti:Gehra Hua (Viral Hook)]
[ar:Arijit Singh x Shashwat Sachdev]
[al:Dhurandhar]
[00:00.00]Tu agar meri, main hoon tera...
[00:07.50]Tu agar meri ye ujaale tere,
[00:13.80]Tu agar meri dil hawaale tere,
[00:18.00]Tu agar meri main hoon tera!
[00:22.00]Betaab-sa mohabbat ka tu inqalaab hai,
[00:29.50]Mera jahaan teri baahon mein khwaab, khwaab hai...
[00:36.80]Gehra hua, gehra hua...
[00:40.50]Rang aashiqui gehra hua, tera hua!
